{"root":"cuaca","ipa":"/tʃua.tʃa/","core":"指大气在短时间内的状态，即天气。通常指温度、湿度、降水、风力等气象要素的综合表现。","pos":["名词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/tʃua.tʃa/","zh":"天气","phrases":[{"t":"cuaca buruk","zh":"恶劣天气"},{"t":"ramalan cuaca","zh":"天气预报"},{"t":"cuaca cerah","zh":"晴朗天气"}],"examples":[{"t":"Cuaca hari ini sangat panas.","zh":"今天的天气非常热。"},{"t":"Penerbangan ditunda karena cuaca buruk.","zh":"由于天气恶劣，航班被延误了。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"cuaca","ipa":"/tʃua.tʃa/","zh":"天气","phrase":{"t":"perubahan cuaca","zh":"天气变化"},"example":{"t":"Kita harus waspada terhadap perubahan cuaca yang mendadak.","zh":"我们必须警惕突如其来的天气变化。"}},{"w":"bercuaca","ipa":"/bər.tʃua.tʃa/","zh":"有某种天气的","phrase":{"t":"bercuaca dingin","zh":"天气寒冷的"},"example":{"t":"Negara itu bercuaca dingin sepanjang tahun.","zh":"那个国家全年天气寒冷。"}}],"derSlugs":["cuaca","bercuaca"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-26T16:28:15.007Z","src":"base"}